  "system": {
    "slug": "geth-colossus",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 14
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>The Geth Colossus is the largest geth ground combat platform, appearing in Mass Effect 1 as a significantly upgraded Geth Armature with greater health, heavier armor, and more powerful weaponry. It is visually distinct by its larger size and platinum-silver armor with ridges along the back.</p><p>Equipped with mass accelerator machine guns and a powerful Siege Pulse cannon, it is one of the most formidable enemies in the first game and can devastate any squad caught in the open.</p>",
